From 26babb6fca341b27415a664d51d1784258ce835a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:25:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add timed tasks with Web Push reminders for Android

Tasks gain a reminder time and lead time. The Go server stores VAPID keys
and push subscriptions in SQLite and sends notifications when a task is
due. The service worker shows them and opens the day on tap. A bell
button in the header enables, disables, and tests reminders.

